{"id":"season_read","html":"<section class=\"exp-md\"><p>In a typical year, <span class=\"ival\" data-i=\"0\">conventional</span> avocados are cheapest in\n<span class=\"ival\" data-i=\"1\">February</span> (<span class=\"ival\" data-i=\"2\">$</span><span class=\"ival\" data-i=\"3\">0.96</span>) and dearest in\n<span class=\"ival\" data-i=\"4\">July</span> (<span class=\"ival\" data-i=\"5\">$</span><span class=\"ival\" data-i=\"6\">1.19</span>). In 2024 they sold\nabove that median in <span class=\"ival\" data-i=\"7\">9</span> of the twelve months.</p>\n</section>","charts":[],"tablemarks":[],"prosemarks":[]}